1254 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The library can\047t contain every type of chart\054 so it only includes the most commonly used ones\056 If a particular chart type will be used in multiple projects\054 it can be added to the library\054 otherwise it should be stored locally\056\050\050Please\054 make sure your project is using the latest version of the components\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 1255 0 R
     /Pg 1240 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
