1258 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The majority of chart components are available in two color variations\072 Monochrome\054 which uses different shades of a single color\054 and Colored\054 which offers a ten\055color palette suitable for both light and dark themes\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 1259 0 R
     /Pg 1240 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

