1266 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Primary and Dark Primary palettes must be used for both light and dark themes\056\050\050Alternatively\054 it also acceptable to use shades of Chart Lights\057Series 1 and Chart Dark\057Series 1\054 directly from the \042Color Styles\042 module\056\050\050In case of Line charts\054 it is recommended to use different shades of the primary palette to get a better contrast and therefore increase legibility\056)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 1267 0 R
     /Pg 1240 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
