1280 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Although this documentation is still a recommendation and not a strict requirement\054 exercising common sense is appreciated\056 Please\054 always ensure that the \042customized\042 charts is accessible\056\050\050For instance\054 if the chart conveys a semantic meaning such as good or bad\054 it is acceptable to use colors from the Success\054 Warning\054 and Error palettes accordingly\056)
     /K [ 20 ]
     /P 1281 0 R
     /Pg 1240 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
