1284 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The order of the colors is important from UX and accessibility perspective\056\050\050The Monochrome charts should be ordered by color shade\056 It is important to ensure that the most important metric is displayed with the highest contrast on the chart\056)
     /K [ 22 ]
     /P 1285 0 R
     /Pg 1240 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
