1286 0 obj
  << /ActualText (When using the ten\055color style\054 there are two suggested approaches of selecting colors for charts\056 The choice is based on two main scenarios\072\nDynamic pages\072\nA situation where the number of metrics or charts are not defined\056 Alternatively\054 users can add\057remove metrics based on needs\056 \050\050Here we strongly recommend to select the Series 1\055\07610 color from Styles\056\050\nPre\055builded pages\072\050\050In the second scenario\054 the number of displayed metrics\057charts is fixed\056\050The recommendation here is to select the colors for each charts based on the predefined order\056)
     /K [ 23 ]
     /P 1287 0 R
     /Pg 1240 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

